*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W5126E00                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  CREATES STOCK VALUE REPORT                            *        
*                BASED ON TURN OVER GROUP AND PRODUCT GROUP            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  AUTHOR     :  SARASWATHY S                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W5126ED1 FB(69 0)                                                          
%W51268  'IN-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
FILE TPFILE1  FB(69 0)                                                          
%W51268  'TP1-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
FILE W5126ED2 VB(135 0)                                                         
UTD3-DATA           1 135   A                                                   
